# Gaius van Baelsar, second mode: "Each player sacrifices a nontoken creature of their choice." (CR 701.21a, 101.4). Bot1 controls
# a Wizard token, a Memnite and Gaius himself (a nontoken creature too, so a choice is asked); Bot1 chooses the Memnite, Bot2 its
# only creature, an Ornithopter. The token stays.

